    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nStunning Three-Bedroom Semi-Detached Home in Excellent Condition\n18 Castleland Park Place presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a beautifully maintained three-bedroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned within this highly regarded modern development in Balbriggan. Built circa 2017 and boasting an impressive B energy rating, this contemporary home combines stylish, spacious accommodation with excellent energy efficiency, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families and those looking to move into a modern, turn-key property.\nInternally, the property offers generous and well-proportioned living accommodation throughout, with a bright and welcoming atmosphere from the moment you step inside. To the front is a separate living room featuring a lovely bay window, creating a comfortable and inviting space for relaxing. To the rear, the heart of the home is the modern kitchen and open-plan dining area, providing an excellent space for everyday family life and entertaining. The dining area benefits from French door access directly onto the rear garden, allowing the indoor and outdoor spaces to flow seamlessly during the warmer months.\nUpstairs, there are three well-appointed bedrooms, with the main bedroom particularly impressive in size and presentation. It benefits from a stylish ensuite shower room and built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage. The remaining bedrooms are bright and versatile, offering ample space for family living, guests or a home office.\nThe property is further enhanced by gas central heating and solar panels, contributing to both comfort and energy efficiency. Outside, there is a large private cobblelock driveway providing ample off-street parking, while the generous rear garden offers excellent private outdoor space and benefits from additional space to the side — a valuable feature for those seeking room to enjoy, entertain or potentially personalise to their own requirements, subject to the necessary permissions.\nCastleland Park Place is a quiet modern cul-de-sac, providing a peaceful residential setting while remaining conveniently close to Balbriggan town centre. Residents can enjoy an excellent range of local amenities, with shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and transport links all within easy reach. The development is also ideally located for those who enjoy coastal living, with Balbriggan Beach and Harbour just a short distance away.\nFor commuters, the property is particularly well positioned, with the M1 motorway only minutes away, providing easy access towards Dublin Airport and Dublin city centre, as well as the wider road network.\nPresented in superb condition throughout and offering modern, spacious accommodation in a peaceful yet highly convenient location, 18 Castleland Park Place is a home that is sure to appeal to a wide range of discerning purchasers. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this impressive property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.5m x 2\nwith tiled flooring, understairs storage\n\nLiving Room - 5.1m x 3.4m\nwith wood flooring, large bay window, T.V. point & ceiling coving, double doors to kitchen.\n\nKitchen Diner - \nL-shaped open plan with excellent range of modern kitchen units and work tops, splashback tiling, built in hob and oven and extractor fan, built in microwave, space for fridge freezer, plumbed for washing machine, tiled flooring, french door to rear garden.\n\nGuest WC - \nwith w.c., w.h.b, tiled floor\n\nfirst floor landing - \nwith hot press and access to attic\n\nBedroom One - 3.7m x 4.55m\nexcellent double room with laminate flooring, built in wardrobes & t.v. point, Ensuite - with tiling floor and shower w.c., w.h.b., shower with glass screens\n\nBedroom Two - 2.8m x 3m\ngood double room with laminate floring and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom Three - 2.35m x 3m\ngood single room with laminate flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.1m x 2m\nwith w.c., w.h.b, bath, tiled flooring and behind bath\n\n"
      },
      {
