        "Content": "<ul><li>Stunning 3 bed Semi-detached house in superb condition</li><li>B Rated / modern built c.2018</li><li>Spacious living accommodation throughout</li><li>Modern Kitchen with open plan dining</li><li>French door access to rear from dining area</li><li>Separate living room to the front with bay window</li><li>Large main bedroom ensuite with built in wardrobes</li><li>Gas central heating and Solar panels</li><li>Large private cobblelock driveway parking with ample parking</li><li>Large private rear garden extra space to the side</li><li>located within quiet modern cul de sac, close to Balbriggan town centre</li><li>Modern development which is close to the beach, harbour and all town centre amenities</li><li>Minutes drive to M1 motor giving easy access to Dublin Airport and city centre</ul>"
